  "statement_html": "\tRead about John Fitzgerald Kennedy and answer the questions\t <span class=\"disabled_link oef_specialhelp\" data-help=\"reading\">[read Kennedy's biography]</span> \t          <p>\t     1 :   &nbsp;\t     JF Kennedy was</p>\t                  <div class=\"question\">\t   <ol>\t        <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> American</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> of French origin</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> of Irish origin</label></li>     </ol>\t </div>\t                      <p>\t     2 :   &nbsp;\t     Kennedy’s family</p>\t                  <div class=\"question\">\t   <ol>\t        <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"1\" /> had nothing to do with politics</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"2\" /> were from the West coast</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"3\" /> had always been involved in politics</label></li>     </ol>\t </div>\t                      <p>\t     3 :   &nbsp;\t     JF Kennedy</p>\t                  <div class=\"question\">\t   <ol>\t        <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"1\" /> wasn’t even thirty when he got his first political mandate</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"2\" /> was a Republican</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"3\" /> was against segregation</label></li>     </ol>\t </div>\t               ",
